  "description": "Make your creative projects stand out with this pink and black horizontal stripe seamless pattern. The combination of soft pink, neon pink, and black creates a playful yet dramatic design that blends feminine charm with gothic lolita and alternative style. Its clean horizontal lines make it easy to use as a repeating background for digital artwork, fashion concepts, stationery, packaging, and a wide range of printable projects.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Gothic lolita and punk-inspired designs\n• Alternative fashion graphics\n• Digital scrapbooking and journaling\n• Planner covers and stationery\n• Gift wrap and product packaging\n• Phone backgrounds and wallpapers\n• Fabric and textile prints\n• Invitations and printable crafts",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Make your creative projects stand out with this pink and black horizontal stripe seamless pattern. The combination of soft pink, neon pink, and black creates a playful yet dramatic design that blends feminine charm with gothic lolita and alternative style. Its clean horizontal lines make it easy to use as a repeating background for digital artwork, fashion concepts, stationery, packaging, and a wide range of printable projects.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n• 15 seamless patterns<br>\n• Format: JPEG<br>\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n• High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n• Gothic lolita and punk-inspired designs<br>\n• Alternative fashion graphics<br>\n• Digital scrapbooking and journaling<br>\n• Planner covers and stationery<br>\n• Gift wrap and product packaging<br>\n• Phone backgrounds and wallpapers<br>\n• Fabric and textile prints<br>\n• Invitations and printable crafts</p>",
